	</li>
	<li data-end="5821" data-section-id="ygdy6z" data-start="5799">
	<p data-end="5821" data-start="5801">сцена, звук и свет</p>
	</li>
	<li data-end="5845" data-section-id="1544vcr" data-start="5822">
	<p data-end="5845" data-start="5824"><a href="/art-concept">оформление площадки</a></p>
	</li>
	<li data-end="5872" data-section-id="14z4391" data-start="5846">
	<p data-end="5872" data-start="5848">видеосъёмка мероприятия.</p>
	</li>
</ul>

<p data-end="5886" data-start="5874">Мы проводим:</p>

<ul data-end="6012" data-start="5888">
	<li data-end="5917" data-section-id="15xipx8" data-start="5888">
